### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@email = rop@adcrm.local
@password = ChangeMe123!

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Organization profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/organization-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Document library summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-library/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-library?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Specifications only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/document-library?type=SPECIFICATION&page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contracts for company 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/contracts?companyId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rotation schedule
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/schedule?year=2026&weekFrom=34&weekTo=41
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CRM week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deals?year=2026&week=36
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
